OL,3,GNEWSATown's 215-year-old chapel goes to
OL,4,Aauction for #1
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 19th Century revivalist chapel is
OL,7,Fgoing to auction with a guide price of
OL,8,Fjust a #1.
OL,10,FThe Grade II listed Ebenezer Chapel
OL,11,Fonce held up to 900 worshippers but the
OL,12,Fbuilding, with its long curved pews and
OL,13,Fhigh arched windows, was last used in
OL,14,F2009 and is now overgrown and derelict.
OL,16,FPaul Fosh Auctions said the
OL,17,F"substantial detached property" in
OL,18,FAberdare, Rhondda Cynon Taf, had
OL,19,Fpartial renovation work done but its
OL,20,Fplanning permission for conversion to
OL,21,Ffive flats had now lapsed.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
